## Choosing a version

Versions follow [SemVer 2.0.0](https://semver.org/). The first release is {{.FirstVersion}}.
{{- if .StartsBeforeOne}}

Before 1.0.0, SemVer allows anything to change, so this repository uses the common convention:

- Minor: any breaking change
- Patch: everything else, including new features and bug fixes
{{- end}}

From 1.0.0:

- Major: any breaking change
- Minor: new features that existing users can ignore
- Patch: bug fixes, documentation, and internal changes

